  "description": "Is there any meal more fun than enchiladas? Make a hearty kidney bean filling, spoon it into soft flour tortillas and then top with smoked\nCheddar for melted cheesy deliciousness. Serve with a cucumber-studded salad for clean flavours and crunch and you can't go wrong!\nThe current labour\nshortages have impacted\navailability of ingredients\nacross the entire food\nsupply chain. As such,\nwhat you receive may\nbe slightly different to\nwhat’s pictured. Don’t\nworry, your recipe will be\njust as delicious!",
