  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the brown onion and garlic. Drain the\n• sweetcorn. Grate the carrot. Drain and rinse the\n• red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f0e1c7cf667676b4587b10/step-a4721bb7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! This is a mild spice blend, but use less if\n• you're sensitive to heat. In a large frying pan, heat\n• a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook the carrot and 1/2 the onion, stirring, until\n• softened, 5 minutes. Add the All-American spice\n• blend, sweetcorn and 1/2 the garlic and cook until\n• fragrant, 1 minute. Add the water, red kidney\n• beans, butter and 1/2 the diced tomatoes with\n• garlic & onion. Season with salt and pepper, then\n• stir to combine. Simmer until the mixture is slightly\n• thickened, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f0e1c7cf667676b4587b10/step-6e450d4a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook the remaining onion, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes. Add the remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Stir in the remaining diced tomatoes and the brown sugar. Remove from the heat, then season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f0e1c7cf667676b4587b10/step-dfccb698.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the grill to high. Grate the smoked Cheddar cheese. Lay the mini flour tortillas on a chopping board. Spoon some bean filling down the centre of a tortilla. Roll it up tightly and place, seam-side down, in a baking dish. Repeat with remaining tortillas and bean filling, ensuring the tortillas fit together snugly. Pour over the sauce, then sprinkle with the smoked Cheddar cheese. Grill the enchiladas until the cheese is melted and golden and the tortillas have warmed through, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f0e1c7cf667676b4587b10/step-94bbdde8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the enchiladas are grilling, thinly slice the\n• cucumber into half-moons. Finely shred cos\n• lettuce (see ingredients). In a medium bowl,\n• combine the honey and a drizzle of white wine\n• vinegar and olive oil. Season, then add the\n• cucumber and lettuce. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f0e1c7cf667676b4587b10/step-e8f589e8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the smoked Cheddar, veggie and bean enchiladas between plates. Top with a dollop of light sour cream. Serve with the salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61f0e1c7cf667676b4587b10/step-cddbe7cc.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
